# --- Solo mode AI scoring (pick ONE; heuristic fallback is used if both are empty) ---

# Native Anthropic API key (sk-ant-...). Takes priority if set.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# OpenCode Go gateway key (https://opencode.ai/docs/ja/go), OpenAI-compatible.
# Used only if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not set.
# OPENCODE_API_KEY=
# OPENCODE_MODEL=kimi-k2.6

# --- Multiplayer room storage (optional) ---
# Without these, rooms are kept in an in-memory Map, which only works
# correctly for a single `next dev` / single-instance process. Set ONE pair
# for real multiplayer on Vercel:
#
# Option A — direct Upstash account (https://upstash.com, free tier):
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
#
# Option B — Vercel's Marketplace "Redis" integration (Storage tab):
# auto-injects these into your Vercel project, no action needed locally.
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
